    We do our best to keep meeting dates, rooms, and topics correct, but plans change. Dates marked “might change” are not final.
    For the latest updates, join our GroupMe or follow us on Instagram. We are not responsible for any problems caused by a
    schedule change.
  </p>

  <h2>Our content</h2>
  <p>
    The text, design, logo, figures, and photos on this site belong to NeuroGIDAS or to the people who made them. Photos of club
    members are used with their permission and may not be copied or reused. You are welcome to link to any page and to share the
    site with others. Please don’t copy our content and present it as your own.
  </p>
  <p>
    The textbook From Neuron to Bedside is a separate project by its author and has its own license, which is listed on the
    textbook’s website.
  </p>

  <h2>Other websites</h2>
  <p>
    We link to outside services such as GroupMe, Instagram, Google Calendar, miRcore, and free research databases. We don’t
    control those sites and aren’t responsible for their content, availability, or how they handle your information. Their own
    terms and privacy policies apply when you use them.
  </p>

  <h2>Acceptable use</h2>
  <p>Please don’t try to break, overload, or get unauthorized access to the site, and don’t use it for anything illegal.</p>

  <h2>No warranty</h2>
  <p>
    The site is provided “as is.” We try to keep it accurate and working, but we can’t promise that everything on it will always
    be complete, correct, or available.
  </p>

  <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
  <p>
