    site, relying on its content, or using any website it links to.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes to these terms</h2>
  <p>
    We may update these terms from time to time. When we do, we will change the date at the top of this page. Using the site
    after a change means you accept the updated terms.
  </p>

  <h2>Governing law</h2>
  <p>These terms are governed by the laws of the State of Minnesota.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Questions about these terms? Email <a href={`mailto:${LINKS.email}`}>{LINKS.email}</a>.
  </p>
</LegalPage>
